# Asian Option Pricing: Monte Carlo vs Neural Network

This project investigates and compares the performance of two predictive models in the approximation of the price of an **arithmetic Asian call option**:

- A classical **Monte Carlo simulation**
- A **neural network regression model** trained on simulated data

The benchmark used for training and evaluation is the price of a **geometric Asian option**, which has a known closed-form solution. The goal is to assess how well each model predicts the arithmetic option price, and to compare their **accuracy** and **speed**.

